OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 27 Aug to Sat 5 SepFA
OL,6,Frelatively unsettled start to this
OL,7,Fperiod, as showers or longer spells of
OL,8,Frain are possible across many parts of
OL,9,Fthe UK. Some heavy bursts and
OL,10,Fthunderstorms are likely at times. It
OL,11,Fwill likely remain changeable into
OL,12,Fearly September, with rainfall amounts
OL,13,Fprobably above average for the time
OL,14,Fyear and the potential for some
OL,15,Fstronger winds at times. However, some
OL,16,Fdrier, more settled interludes could
OL,17,Fdevelop at times. Temperatures are
OL,18,Flikely to be near average, although
OL,19,Fsome short-lived warm or hot spells
OL,20,Fare possible, especially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
